WEBVTT

00:05:57.334 --> 00:06:00.437
what you have is a dead tomato society.

00:06:01.183 --> 00:06:03.365
So he said, this is what I want to do.

00:06:03.389 --> 00:06:05.945
And he got together
with the Campbell's soup kitchen,

00:06:05.969 --> 00:06:09.430
and he made 45 varieties
of spaghetti sauce.

00:06:09.454 --> 00:06:12.307
And he varied them according
to every conceivable way

00:06:12.331 --> 00:06:13.976
that you can vary tomato sauce:

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.858
by sweetness, by level of garlic,

00:06:15.882 --> 00:06:19.097
by tomatoey-ness,
by tartness, by sourness,

00:06:19.121 --> 00:06:20.461
by visible solids --

00:06:20.485 --> 00:06:23.746
my favorite term
in the spaghetti sauce business.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.771
(Laughter)

00:06:24.795 --> 00:06:28.333
Every conceivable way
you can vary spaghetti sauce,

00:06:28.357 --> 00:06:30.136
he varied spaghetti sauce.